{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "am-identity-collection-v1",
    "name": "AM Identity Service",
    "description": "Organized API collection for **am-identity** (port 8113).\n\n## Quick start\n1. Import `AM-Identity.local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Run **Health → Health Check**\n3. Run **Auth → Login** (or Google SSO flow)\n4. `access_token` / `refresh_token` are saved automatically\n5. Run **Users → Get My Profile**\n\n## Folders\n| Folder | Purpose |\n|--------|----------|\n| 00 Health | Liveness |\n| 01 Auth — Registration | Sign up |\n| 02 Auth — Login & Session | Password login, refresh, logout |\n| 03 Auth — Google SSO | URL + callback (manual browser step for `code`) |\n| 04 Users | Bearer-protected profile/settings |\n| 05 Internal | Service-account only |\n| 99 Keycloak Helpers | Direct token calls for setup/debug |\n\n## Gateway (future)\nPublic routes via Traefik: `/api/auth/*`, `/api/users/*`\n| 06 Device Link | QR web login |\n| 07 Web OTP | Email/SMS web login |\n| 08 BFF | Cookie session |\n| 09 Security | Events + sessions |\n| 10 Step-Up | Trading prep |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.get('base_url')) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('base_url', 'http://localhost:8113');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const ok = pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300;",
          "if (!ok) return;",
          "try {",
          "  const body = pm.response.json();",
          "  if (body.access_token) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
          "  }",
          "  if (body.refresh_token) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refresh_token);",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', body.refresh_token);",
          "  }",
          "  if (body.state) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('google_state', body.state);",
          "  }",
          "  if (body.auth_url) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('google_auth_url', body.auth_url);",
          "  }",
          "  if (body.sub) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('user_sub', body.sub);",
          "  }",
          "} catch (e) {}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
